WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:05.320
~izu presents~

00:00.350 --> 00:05.320
Papa to Kiss in the Dark
Episode 1

00:14.040 --> 00:16.740
Man, is it already this time?

00:17.150 --> 00:19.510
I'm late! I'm definitely late!

00:22.380 --> 00:23.320
Kyosuke!

00:27.820 --> 00:29.590
I was right. You're still a sleep!

00:30.530 --> 00:34.590
Didn't you promise me that you would
wake up at 6:30 AM and be ready?

00:35.060 --> 00:38.590
Today is my big day for the
start of my academy years!

00:40.600 --> 00:45.100
Who's the bad boy that's
interrupting my sleep?

00:45.870 --> 00:48.210
Who is there other than me?

00:49.240 --> 00:52.010
If we don't hurry up, we'll be
late for the enrollment ceremony!

00:52.080 --> 00:53.780
Hey, Kyosuke!

00:56.220 --> 00:57.210
Kyosuke!

00:59.150 --> 01:01.310
You come in here too.

01:03.160 --> 01:05.060
Let's go back to sleep together.

01:05.260 --> 01:06.190
Stop joking!

01:06.290 --> 01:08.690
I beg you, please don't
go to bed naked. Naked!

01:10.260 --> 01:11.470
I'm wearing...

01:11.470 --> 01:11.960
I'm wearing...
What?

01:14.570 --> 01:16.540
...Channel's Egoiste.

01:17.370 --> 01:18.700
Faint!

01:19.140 --> 01:21.730
Good morning, my cute Mira.

01:24.680 --> 01:27.670
We are family, aren't we? Family!

01:33.390 --> 01:35.880
I'm late! I'm definitely late!

01:40.030 --> 01:41.290
This is bad.

01:41.400 --> 01:43.830
I'm late from the first day
at the academy.

01:44.530 --> 01:47.330
I worked so hard and got in
the academy of first choice.

01:47.570 --> 01:51.440
Damn it. This happened
because of Kyosuke!

01:52.710 --> 01:54.830
If he didn't start such a thing...

01:55.810 --> 01:57.330
That perverted actor.

01:58.980 --> 02:01.850
It's not like he's a porn actor, but...

02:02.820 --> 02:03.280
Emergency Life Saving ERO

02:03.280 --> 02:04.890
Emergency Life Saving ERO
He's been in Hollywood movies.

02:04.890 --> 02:05.220
He's been in Hollywood movies.

02:05.220 --> 02:05.850
Eros x Gal Killer
He's been in Hollywood movies.

02:05.850 --> 02:07.840
Eros x Gal Killer

02:11.690 --> 02:13.750
If you do it like this...

02:13.860 --> 02:14.350
Stop.

02:15.930 --> 02:17.920
A lot more...

02:21.470 --> 02:23.400
Not that...

02:26.410 --> 02:28.340
I need to get inside somehow.

02:29.880 --> 02:32.280
Yeah! I found an entrance!

02:38.220 --> 02:39.190
Kyosuke?

02:40.220 --> 02:43.280
No, I'm sure he's still sleeping.

02:47.860 --> 02:49.630
No, it won't open.

02:50.730 --> 02:52.460
Not here either.

02:55.940 --> 02:56.240
Failure

02:56.240 --> 02:58.400
Failure
Man, why is it like this?

02:59.440 --> 03:02.670
Where is the building
for first-year students?

03:11.050 --> 03:11.640
Huh?

03:12.090 --> 03:14.580
What are you doing in a place like this?

03:14.960 --> 03:15.420
Huh?

03:15.960 --> 03:18.430
Aren't you a new student?

03:21.300 --> 03:22.490
Upperclassman?

03:23.460 --> 03:26.430
No, um... Well, I got lost...

03:26.970 --> 03:29.030
So you are a first-year student.

03:29.300 --> 03:29.930
Y-yes!

03:31.010 --> 03:34.410
On top of being lost, I couldn't
get into the building from anywhere.

03:34.780 --> 03:37.870
Also, I couldn't remember
what class I am suppose to be in...

03:38.310 --> 03:39.440
I made it up...

03:39.910 --> 03:42.680
I see. But everything is
going to be just fine now.

03:44.520 --> 03:45.450
Your name is?

03:45.590 --> 03:46.310
I...

03:48.020 --> 03:49.180
I mean...

03:50.860 --> 03:52.690
My name is Munakata!

03:52.830 --> 03:53.990
Munakata...

03:55.100 --> 03:56.960
My name is Mira Munakata!

03:57.060 --> 03:57.620
What?

03:58.630 --> 04:01.260
With the kanji for fruit and
kanji for goodness, it's Mira!

04:03.440 --> 04:05.270
Really? That's a cute name.

04:08.280 --> 04:10.800
This guy... He's really tall...

04:11.050 --> 04:13.040
...and his face is really good looking.

04:14.150 --> 04:17.080
He didn't make a weird face
when I said my name.

04:18.320 --> 04:19.090
Student Council

04:19.090 --> 04:21.280
Student Council
Student council president?

04:21.560 --> 04:23.290
Yeah, that's right.

04:23.820 --> 04:26.790
I'm Takayuki Utsunomiya, third-year.

04:27.660 --> 04:29.290
Nice to meet you, Mira.

04:30.160 --> 04:31.360
I was right.

04:32.070 --> 04:34.060
Mira, you are in the 3rd class.

04:34.270 --> 04:35.740
Oh, is that so?

04:36.040 --> 04:37.300
I'm glad.

04:38.440 --> 04:39.430
By the way...

04:40.910 --> 04:44.000
...where is first-year
3rd classroom located?

04:46.850 --> 04:50.280
All the teachers are in the
teacher's lounge, so you should be...

04:50.350 --> 04:52.150
...able to get into
the classroom easily!

04:52.250 --> 04:53.410
Hooray!

04:53.820 --> 04:54.310
Ah...

04:56.620 --> 05:00.720
Mira, thanks to you, my academy life
might become more enjoyable!

05:01.030 --> 05:01.690
What?

05:06.370 --> 05:10.630
On the enrollment ceremony list,
I'll mark it as you were present.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.770
Thank you very much!

05:32.230 --> 05:35.130
Yes! The teacher and the
parents aren't here yet!

05:35.530 --> 05:36.720
During this time...

05:37.200 --> 05:37.820
Mira!

05:38.130 --> 05:39.220
Over here, over here!

05:39.530 --> 05:40.060
Huh?

05:40.470 --> 05:41.230
Kazu?

05:44.310 --> 05:46.240
I saved you a seat.

05:46.640 --> 05:47.670
Oh yeah...

05:47.880 --> 05:51.540
I forgot that my childhood friend Kazu
got into Hakuou with me.

05:52.110 --> 05:53.740
Come on. Come over here.

05:59.550 --> 06:01.040
You're in the same class too?

06:01.120 --> 06:01.650
Yeah.

06:01.960 --> 06:03.480
But why did you know?

06:03.720 --> 06:07.290
That's 'cause I checked on
the class assignment chart.

06:09.330 --> 06:12.600
As expected, he's
always a thoughtful guy.

06:18.910 --> 06:22.100
Where were you during
the enrollment ceremony?

06:22.340 --> 06:24.140
Y-yeah, well...

06:24.350 --> 06:25.510
