06:29.520 --> 06:31.080
I was worried about you.

06:32.250 --> 06:33.520
W-what?

06:35.460 --> 06:36.720
What happened?

06:36.790 --> 06:37.280
What?

06:37.490 --> 06:39.190
Well, something...

06:39.830 --> 06:42.690
Were you guys fighting on the
morning of the enrollment ceremony?

06:46.570 --> 06:47.470
Mira...

06:52.140 --> 06:52.940
No...

06:56.440 --> 06:57.140
Shun?

07:01.280 --> 07:02.040
Shun?

07:02.320 --> 07:04.610
The one that moved away
during elementary school?

07:08.490 --> 07:10.390
Never thought I'd see you
in a place like this.

07:12.060 --> 07:13.220
Y-You...

07:13.430 --> 07:15.160
Weren't you on TV the other day?

07:15.730 --> 07:17.890
I heard you are going from
lndies to major debut...

07:18.470 --> 07:20.260
You were watching?

07:20.940 --> 07:22.560
So it was you.

07:23.000 --> 07:25.670
Your dream from
when you were little came true!

07:32.210 --> 07:35.440
When I grow up, I'm going
to become a musician!

07:35.580 --> 07:37.350
I'll become a soccer player!

07:38.520 --> 07:39.450
I'll...

07:39.850 --> 07:41.790
Um, um...

07:42.120 --> 07:42.820
Mira!

07:44.690 --> 07:46.250
Ah, Papa!

07:48.660 --> 07:50.990
I'm going to become Papa's bride!

07:57.940 --> 08:02.240
I'm in the soccer team and he's
still in mutual love with Papa-san.

08:03.510 --> 08:06.500
Dangerous

08:08.120 --> 08:11.050
Does Kazu know about Kyosuke and l?

08:11.520 --> 08:13.280
No, there's no way!

08:13.920 --> 08:15.390
But wait a second...

08:15.660 --> 08:17.060
Papa, I love you!

08:17.830 --> 08:20.390
I didn't know when I was a little kid...

08:20.530 --> 08:23.000
Splash, splash, splash.

08:24.000 --> 08:27.130
...that it wasn't normal to do
those things as a family.

08:30.600 --> 08:34.870
By any chance, did I tell them
something really bad?

08:35.810 --> 08:37.400
Hey Shun!

08:39.110 --> 08:40.440
Well, I'll see you later.

08:40.550 --> 08:41.070
Okay.

08:43.420 --> 08:45.410
I'm always watching your shows!

08:45.950 --> 08:48.350
Munakata-san, you are so
wonderful on TV also, but...

08:48.460 --> 08:51.190
You are more wonderful in person.

08:51.660 --> 08:52.650
Thank you very much.

08:56.360 --> 08:57.600
Hey, it's Papa-san.

08:57.600 --> 08:58.160
Hey, it's Papa-san.
Huh?

08:58.970 --> 09:00.730
He is here?

09:01.240 --> 09:03.570
Then the car before was definitely...

09:06.710 --> 09:09.570
While I was doing everything
I could to make it to school...

09:09.680 --> 09:11.270
...he came with a car.

09:11.580 --> 09:14.780
Even so, Kyosuke-san hasn't changed.

09:15.680 --> 09:20.120
My mom using the fact that he knows
her by face and she's clinging to him.

09:21.460 --> 09:23.550
Papa-san is definitely young...

09:23.890 --> 09:25.120
How old is he?

09:25.460 --> 09:26.430
He's 33.

09:27.330 --> 09:29.060
But it's definitely a lie.

09:29.230 --> 09:33.060
Because with my age, he can't
be that young and be my father!

09:34.900 --> 09:36.030
Certainly.

09:41.380 --> 09:42.640
I hate him.

09:56.160 --> 09:59.420
I hate Kyosuke.

10:04.330 --> 10:06.270
Who did you say you hate?

10:08.300 --> 10:09.290
Kyosuke...

10:11.570 --> 10:14.440
You are already an academy student,
huh?

10:19.610 --> 10:21.210
What is it all of a sudden?

10:22.950 --> 10:24.580
That was pretty fast.

10:37.670 --> 10:38.830
Well...

10:39.930 --> 10:44.560
I took off to be present at
your enrollment ceremony...

10:47.370 --> 10:51.370
...we have some time so why not continue
from where we left off this morning?

10:54.010 --> 10:56.070
I only had milk since this morning.

10:56.650 --> 10:58.680
Papa is hungry.

10:59.050 --> 11:01.920
Mira, you're not satisfied
with just milk too, right?

11:03.090 --> 11:04.110
Milk?

11:12.000 --> 11:14.630
T-then, why don't we
go get something to eat?

11:14.740 --> 11:15.530
No.

11:15.670 --> 11:17.000
Let's do that!

11:17.100 --> 11:20.340
I'm sorry, but I am in
the mood to eat at home.

11:22.180 --> 11:24.580
Look. Right here is my favorite...

11:24.680 --> 11:26.910
No, don't. What are you saying...

11:46.970 --> 11:47.630
Yes.

11:48.200 --> 11:50.260
Ah, thank you for everything before.

11:51.170 --> 11:53.370
What? Right now?

11:54.010 --> 11:55.530
Yes, that's okay.

11:56.280 --> 11:57.470
Kyosuke?

11:57.640 --> 11:59.580
I'm off today, so...

12:05.490 --> 12:07.720
In front of Kawagishi Park Station?

12:08.320 --> 12:09.250
That's fine.

12:10.090 --> 12:11.460
At 7 o'clock?

12:14.060 --> 12:17.520
What? The promise for a date
with someone else?

12:18.700 --> 12:19.320
Yes.

12:19.730 --> 12:22.130
Then I will come
pick you up with my car.

12:25.170 --> 12:26.300
Hooray!

12:26.810 --> 12:28.600
Serves you right!

12:29.340 --> 12:31.830
Ah, no, it's nothing.

12:32.510 --> 12:34.110
Then I will see you later.

12:36.050 --> 12:37.610
Well, let's see...

12:38.650 --> 12:42.180
I'm thinking of taking a
shower before I leave, but...

12:43.160 --> 12:45.630
...I need to punish a bad boy.

12:47.960 --> 12:50.620
From right now,
I'll make you understand...

12:51.500 --> 12:54.560
...what it's like to be a woman.

12:54.640 --> 12:55.620
No...

12:59.440 --> 13:02.140
Academy students are all male!

13:16.890 --> 13:18.520
H-hey, Mira?

13:18.730 --> 13:20.750
Morning, Kazu...

13:24.200 --> 13:26.460
The sun is yellow.

13:33.670 --> 13:35.870
You be a good boy and stay home.

13:44.080 --> 13:46.420
What do you mean by class meeting?

13:46.650 --> 13:48.520
Who are you meeting up with?

13:50.090 --> 13:51.490
Damn it!

13:51.790 --> 13:54.560
What the hell is he doing sex surfing?

13:58.230 --> 14:00.100
H-hey, Mira!

14:00.530 --> 14:01.260
Huh?

14:04.270 --> 14:05.830
Ouch...

14:06.010 --> 14:07.100
Idiot.

14:07.410 --> 14:09.880
You've been out of it
even though it's still morning.

14:10.440 --> 14:11.840
Arg!

14:12.480 --> 14:14.070
I don't care anymore!

14:14.310 --> 14:18.310
I'm making a new start from this year!

14:18.620 --> 14:19.710
Right, Kazu?

14:20.020 --> 14:21.390
Y-yeah...

14:26.230 --> 14:28.660
Good morning, Lost kitten.

14:30.500 --> 14:33.160
Good morning, Utsunomiya senpai.

14:33.700 --> 14:34.460
Ah?

14:34.770 --> 14:37.100
Thank you for the other day.

14:38.240 --> 14:41.110
Thanks to you, I was able
to become your underclassman.

14:46.650 --> 14:49.340
It's okay. You can talk to me
however you like.

14:54.450 --> 14:56.510
You are really cute.

15:00.130 --> 15:00.720
Hmm?

15:07.500 --> 15:08.090
Bye.

15:08.600 --> 15:10.160
See you at school.

15:13.610 --> 15:15.910
You should watch out.

15:16.010 --> 15:17.270
You think so?

15:22.020 --> 15:26.610
I wonder if that perverted old man
is cheating on me as we speak.

15:36.000 --> 15:39.120
I heard this time it's definite for marriage.
When is your wedding planned for?

15:39.870 --> 15:43.800
Mizuki-san! What is your son in law
think about Kyosuke Munakata?

15:44.810 --> 15:47.140
Mizuki-san! Please say something!

16:05.690 --> 16:08.350
He promised me he'd be home early
today!

16:15.740 --> 16:17.470
Hey, Kyosuke.

16:18.410 --> 16:20.200
You're always so beautiful.

16:20.440 --> 16:22.140
That makes me happy.

16:23.380 --> 16:26.040
By the way, is Mira-kun doing well?

16:28.820 --> 16:31.250
He became an academy student, right?

16:32.650 --> 16:34.850
Yeah, he did.

16:44.560 --> 16:45.460
Tell me...

16:47.170 --> 16:48.430
...in detail later...

16:55.180 --> 16:57.610
What's up with this air?

17:15.930 --> 17:17.260
What the hell...

17:18.130 --> 17:21.460
I made dinner and he doesn't even call.

17:31.680 --> 17:33.910
Don't tell me he's
with someone else again!

17:37.450 --> 17:38.380
I can't!

17:38.620 --> 17:40.480
My jealousy is totally obvious!

17:43.620 --> 17:46.290
Why is someone like him my father...

17:48.330 --> 17:50.420
Why is he my lover?

18:06.780 --> 18:08.410
He went to bed already?

18:13.950 --> 18:14.720
Mira?

18:17.990 --> 18:18.860
Mira...

18:29.240 --> 18:30.130
Mira...

18:37.340 --> 18:39.180
I'm going to move out!

18:40.610 --> 18:44.350
I'm going to move out like mom
who left us so long ago!

18:46.420 --> 18:47.250
Mira!

18:49.590 --> 18:51.110
You are the only one.

18:53.190 --> 18:54.320
To me...

18:54.690 --> 18:56.090
...you are the only one.

18:59.400 --> 19:00.300
Kyosuke.

19:14.350 --> 19:19.380
My only reason to live
in this world is you.

19:20.890 --> 19:24.380
There is no replacement
for you anywhere, Mira.

19:45.780 --> 19:49.740
Oh no, I forgot to give this
to Kyosuke yesterday.

19:50.120 --> 19:52.380
Do I have to submit this
within this week?

19:52.490 --> 19:54.390
Crap, it's till tomorrow.

19:55.160 --> 19:56.620
I remember you can only get...

19:56.720 --> 19:59.560
...a copy of the family register
in your permanent domicile.

20:00.160 --> 20:02.860
Hey Shun! Are you
going to the studio now?

20:03.500 --> 20:04.690
Y-yeah.

20:06.270 --> 20:08.930
Our permanent domicile
is the next county over.

20:12.010 --> 20:13.340
Well, I'm off.

20:13.470 --> 20:15.100
Yeah, good luck.

20:22.250 --> 20:24.410
Kazu, come with me for a little!

20:24.520 --> 20:26.390
I'm going to join the soccer team...

20:26.390 --> 20:28.150
I'm going to join the soccer team...
Can you do that tomorrow?

20:28.260 --> 20:30.220
Mine is an emergency!

20:38.530 --> 20:38.970
Munakata

20:38.970 --> 20:40.970
Munakata
I can't believe we need a seal...

20:40.970 --> 20:41.030
Munakata

20:41.030 --> 20:42.440
Munakata
...to get the copy of the original.

20:42.440 --> 20:42.900
...to get the copy of the original.

20:42.970 --> 20:44.490
I wasted 300 yen.

20:44.570 --> 20:45.900
There, there.

20:46.610 --> 20:48.840
Hey, remember how
they use to have secrets...

20:48.910 --> 20:51.500
...about your birth in
old dramas and mangas?

20:51.680 --> 20:52.200
What?

20:52.580 --> 20:55.840
I remember Kyosuke being in
something like that before too.

20:55.920 --> 20:56.910
Oh, I know!

20:57.380 --> 21:00.150
Kyosuke-san was the brother of
the girl with the main roll, but...

21:00.350 --> 21:02.380
...they weren't actually
related by blood.

21:02.690 --> 21:04.550
And he got really confused, but...

21:04.660 --> 21:07.220
...somewhere along the line
they loved each other.

21:07.330 --> 21:08.760
It's unbelievable, right?

21:09.660 --> 21:11.690
I thought it was so lame.

21:11.770 --> 21:15.290
But I was watching with my mom
and I actually cried during it.

21:15.470 --> 21:16.990
Are you serious?

21:19.870 --> 21:24.330
Hey, what would you do if you
weren't really Kyosuke-san's son?

21:24.810 --> 21:27.010
Of course I'm going to be glad.

21:27.580 --> 21:30.280
And you guys will love each other...

21:30.350 --> 21:31.010
Huh?

21:32.520 --> 21:34.040
What's wrong?

21:34.220 --> 21:36.090
Ah, no...nothing.

21:36.960 --> 21:40.320
My father and l?
You got to be kidding me...

21:40.890 --> 21:43.420
But being gay, having a Shotaro
complex, and committing incest...

21:43.530 --> 21:45.690
Then am I going to have one less issue?

21:45.800 --> 21:47.030
Y-you...

21:47.200 --> 21:49.070
Don't say it yourself!

21:49.140 --> 21:51.540
It hurts. Stop!

21:51.610 --> 21:53.540
Ward Residents lntegration Window

21:53.540 --> 21:54.870
Ward Residents lntegration Window
Munakata-san.

21:54.870 --> 21:56.030
Ward Residents lntegration Window

22:01.180 --> 22:02.650
This can't be true...

22:03.950 --> 22:05.140
What's wrong?

22:07.690 --> 22:09.020
Are you serious?

22:16.160 --> 22:17.030
Mira...

22:18.830 --> 22:19.730
Kazu...

22:20.100 --> 22:21.030
I'm not...

22:24.040 --> 22:26.770
...Kyosuke's real son?

22:32.150 --> 22:35.270
It's a lie, right?

22:36.650 --> 22:40.210
As much for me to forget to blink...

22:40.320 --> 22:43.950
...I'm occupied with
just you all the time.

22:44.120 --> 22:51.330
Please stop the time forever.

22:53.270 --> 22:57.640
This room that no one's in...

23:00.470 --> 23:05.240
The TV is vacant.

23:07.750 --> 23:12.210
I look for a part of you.

23:13.250 --> 23:19.560
Then I pretend I wasn't looking.

23:19.630 --> 23:24.460
Am I wrong? We most likely...

23:24.560 --> 23:28.020
...don't need anything else.

23:28.230 --> 23:38.130
Because not even
one person knows the truth.

23:38.380 --> 23:42.010
As much for me to forget to blink...

23:42.120 --> 23:45.680
...I'm occupied with
just you all the time.

23:45.790 --> 23:52.450
You look through my heart.
Stop my love.

23:52.960 --> 24:00.260
Gentle kiss with just the two of us.
We start the morning again today.

24:00.500 --> 24:06.340
Stop the time, forever...

24:11.610 --> 24:14.670
I wasn't Kyosuke's son...

24:15.150 --> 24:17.810
Then what about our relationship?

24:18.620 --> 24:20.950
On top of that, getting
married to that person?

24:21.120 --> 24:21.780
What?

24:21.920 --> 24:23.550
Kyosuke was in an accident?

24:23.620 --> 24:25.020
Kyosuke!

24:27.990 --> 24:30.190
You reactions are extreme...

24:30.430 --> 24:32.660
Did it turn you on that much?
